{
    "name": "Helped - AI Command Center",
    "flow": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "maxResults": 1
            },
            "mapper": {},
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "notes": "AI Command Center chat webhook. After import: click this module, create a new webhook, name it 'AI Command Center Chat Webhook', copy the URL."
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
            "version": 0,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {
                "files": [],
                "message": "{{1.userPrompt}}\n\nConversation history:\n{{join(map(slice(1.messages; -10); item.role + \": \" + item.content); \"\\n\")}}",
                "threadId": "{{1.scenario}}",
                "outputType": "text",
                "tokenLimit": "80",
                "modelConfig": {
                    "timeout": "",
                    "recursionLimit": "80",
                    "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "1"
                },
                "defaultModel": "small",
                "systemPrompt": "{{1.systemPrompt}}",
                "promptCaching": "none",
                "fallbackEnabled": false
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 450,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "notes": "AI Command Center engine. After import: connect your Make AI Provider connection (same one used by your other AI scenarios)."
            },
            "tools": []
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "json:CreateJSON",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "json": "{\n  \"reply\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "mapper": {
                "json": "{\"reply\": \"{{2.response}}\"}"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 900,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "notes": "Wrap the AI reply in { reply: \"...\" } so the Worker's extractCommandCenterReply can read it."
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 4,
            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {
                "body": "{{3.data}}",
                "status": "200",
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 1350,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "notes": "Return JSON reply to the Worker."
            }
        }
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "instant": true,
        "version": 1,
        "scenario": {
            "roundtrips": 1,
            "maxErrors": 3,
            "autoCommit": true,
            "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
            "sequential": false,
            "slots": null,
            "confidential": false,
            "dataloss": false,
            "dlq": false,
            "freshVariables": false
        },
        "designer": {
            "orphans": []
        },
        "zone": "eu1.make.com",
        "notes": [
            "Helped - AI Command Center - Import-ready blueprint.",
            "",
            "AFTER IMPORT:",
            "1. WEBHOOK: Click Module 1, create a new webhook named 'AI Command Center Chat Webhook', copy its URL.",
            "2. AI AGENT: Click Module 2, connect your Make AI Provider connection.",
            "3. CREATE JSON: Module 3 is pre-configured to return { reply: \"...\" }.",
            "4. WEBHOOK RESPONSE: Module 4 is pre-configured.",
            "5. WORKER SECRET: npx wrangler secret put MAKE_AI_COMMAND_CENTER_WEBHOOK_URL (paste the webhook URL).",
            "6. ACTIVATE: Toggle the scenario ON.",
            "",
            "The Worker sends { type, scenario, systemPrompt, userPrompt, messages, context }.",
            "The AI agent uses 1.systemPrompt (agency data + instructions) and 1.userPrompt + conversation history.",
            "Returns { reply: \"...\" }, which extractCommandCenterReply reads back into the chat."
        ]
    }
}
